ord here runs 75 years back to 1951 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids. July to August came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 that middle ran 155% of normal in May to June and 46% in September to October. Grid 15438 has a preliminary estimate of 18.5 for August to September 2026, and RMA&rsquo;s final index can differ.</p>"}
